{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you will take the body of a pair of shoes that never stop running, forcing you to jump and move forward throughout the entire game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/106e5a3ec03128525bb4f0cc41376073.poster.avif?t=1773001384\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/106e5a3ec03128525bb4f0cc41376073.webm?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/106e5a3ec03128525bb4f0cc41376073.mp4?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Mo, your moai friend, you can charge energy, launch him, and propel yourself towards him. Mastering the charge , the timing of when to launch, and when to dash toward him is a skill only a few will achieve\u2014but it\u2019s essential to complete your mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/f36cf6a6cddd5645009ca0218324fbb7.poster.avif?t=1773001384\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/f36cf6a6cddd5645009ca0218324fbb7.webm?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/f36cf6a6cddd5645009ca0218324fbb7.mp4?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall, every mistake, must be a lesson that makes you stronger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/68b364ecd55296011de2564ab01a5cde.poster.avif?t=1773001384\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/68b364ecd55296011de2564ab01a5cde.webm?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/68b364ecd55296011de2564ab01a5cde.mp4?t=1773001384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the vast Moai world , from its deep sewers to the white tower in top of the world, passing through unique environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>So take on this challenge and embark on this epic adventure!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562110?t=1773001384","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562110?t=1773001384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/0438e43993a40990bcc4a84c6b153dee1fb7fd31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773001384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/0438e43993a40990bcc4a84c6b153dee1fb7fd31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773001384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"d